title: 'feat(utility): add dispatch_as_signed extrinsic (RFC #11099)'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |-
      # Description

      Introduce a new `dispatch_as_signed` extrinsic in `pallet-utility` that converts a pallet origin (e.g. Treasurer) into its sovereign account and dispatches the given call using that account as a signed origin. Addresses the lack of a direct way to run general calls with a signed origin when initiated by a pallet origin.

